ly bumping into the doctor entering for rounds."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Doctor","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's with her?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nothing. Probably just a bit overwhelmed by all the work."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, by the way—how do I get to Doctor Lawrence's residence?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
